  culture: `<p>News travels fast through family WhatsApp groups, and each retelling adds detail. Egyptians often quote conversations as little dramas, with direct speech and acting: <i>2alli: \"inta feen?\" 2ultilu: \"ana gayy!\"</i>. Mastering this quoted style makes your stories sound native.</p>`,
