  culture: `<p>Ramadan is peak TV season, with dozens of new series competing every year. Classic film lines are everyday references, and quoting one at the right moment is peak Egyptian humour. For listening practice, watch comedies from the 2000s onward and old black-and-white films with Arabic subtitles.</p>`,
